extends baseEmail

block content
  H1 Hello!
  p Please click the button below to verify your email address.
  p Note that the link expires in 10 minutes!
  table.btn.btn-primary(role='presentation' border='0' cellpadding='0' cellspacing='0')
    tbody
      tr
        td(align='left')
          table(role='presentation' border='0' cellpadding='0' cellspacing='0')
            tbody
              tr
                td
                  a(href=`${url}`, target='_blank') Verify Email Address
  p If you did not create an account, no further action is required.